      "title": "dumpcap: create another routine of common code.",
      "message": "dumpcap: create another routine of common code.\n\nThat routine starts writing out a new file, i.e.  writing out the\ninitial SHB and initial IDBs for a pcapng file or the file header for a\npcap file.\n\nRename the routines it calls to match; that makes it a bit clearer what\nthey do, i.e. they start the process of writing out a pcapng and pcap\nfile, respectively.\n",
